@startuml
title Add Word Image Sequence (/api/admin/words/{id}/image)
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Admin
boundary "Vocabulary UI" as VocabularyPage
control "VocabularyController\n(FE Dashboard)" as DashboardController
entity "UploadWordImageRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as ImageRequestDto
entity "WordDetail\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeWordDetailDto
control "AdminWordsController\n(BE API)" as ApiController
entity "WordDetailResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as ImageResponseDto
control "IWordAdminService" as IWordAdminService
control "WordAdminService" as WordService
control "IWordImageStorage" as IWordImageStorage
entity "Word" as WordEntity
control "IWordAdminRepository" as IWordAdminRepository
control "WordAdminRepository" as WordRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over VocabularyPage, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Add image and update image use the same upload flow.
Dashboard VocabularyController uploads image file through VocaNovaApiClient.
API endpoint is POST /api/admin/words/{id}/image.
API uses UploadWordImageRequest and returns WordDetailResponse.
FE response DTO exists: WordDetail when Dashboard reloads word detail.
Interfaces used in code: IWordAdminService, IWordImageStorage, IWordAdminRepository.
end note
Admin -> VocabularyPage: Choose image file for word
Admin -> VocabularyPage: Click Add image
VocabularyPage -> DashboardController: POST /vocabulary/{id}/image
DashboardController -> DashboardController: Validate file exists
alt No image file selected
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show error message
else Image file selected
DashboardController -> ImageRequestDto: VocaNovaApiClient.UploadImageAsync(wordId, image file)\nCreate multipart request(file)
ImageRequestDto -> ApiController: POST /api/admin/words/{id}/image\nUploadWordImageRequest
ApiController -> ApiController: Check admin authorization
ApiController -> ApiController: Bind UploadWordImageRequest
ApiController -> IWordAdminService: UploadImageAsync(wordId, file)
IWordAdminService -> WordService: UploadImageAsync(wordId, file)
WordService -> IWordAdminService: Validate image file(type and size)
IWordAdminService -> WordService: Validate image file(type and size)
alt Image file invalid
WordService --> ApiController: Validation failure
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 400 error
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show error message
else Image file valid
WordService -> IWordAdminRepository: WordExistsAsync(wordId)
IWordAdminRepository -> WordRepository: WordExistsAsync(wordId)
WordRepository -> DbContext: Query word
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT words
MySQL --> DbContext: Word row or null
DbContext -> WordEntity: Materialize Word?
WordEntity --> DbContext: Word or null
DbContext --> WordRepository: Result
WordRepository --> WordService: exists or not
alt Word not found
WordService --> ApiController: NotFound result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 404 error
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show error message
else Word exists
WordService -> IWordImageStorage: UploadAsync(file)
WordService -> IWordAdminRepository: SetImageUrlAsync(wordId, imageUrl)
IWordAdminRepository -> WordRepository: SetImageUrlAsync(wordId, imageUrl)
WordRepository -> WordEntity: Set ImageUrl
WordEntity --> WordRepository: Word updated
WordRepository -> DbContext: Track word image_url
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE words
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
DbContext --> WordRepository: Save result
WordRepository --> WordService: Updated word detail
WordService --> ApiController: Return updated word
ApiController -> ImageResponseDto: Create response data(WordDetailResponse)
ImageResponseDto --> DashboardController: HTTP 200 OK\nWordDetailResponse
DashboardController -> FeWordDetailDto: VocaNovaApiClient.GetWordDetailAsync(wordId)\nGET /api/words/{id}
FeWordDetailDto --> DashboardController: WordDetail
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show added image
end
end
end
@enduml
